  "main": "\n<main>\n\t\t<section class=\"tsc-conditions-hero relative isolate w-full overflow-hidden\">\n\t\t<img class=\"tsc-kenburns absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/focus-metabolic-health.webp\" alt=\"Abstract black and champagne fabric waves representing metabolic flow\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-hero__veil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-hero__fade\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-hero__inner relative z-10 mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] flex-col justify-end px-6 md:px-12\">\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<nav class=\"tsc-crumb flex items-center gap-3 text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.36em] text-[color:var(--champagne)]\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"opacity-70 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" href=\"/\">The Practice</a>\n\t<span class=\"opacity-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span>\n\t<span class=\"opacity-70\">What we treat</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"opacity-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span>\n\t<span>Metabolic health</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"mt-8 max-w-4xl font-serif text-[clamp(3rem,7vw,5.4rem)] leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.015em] text-[color:var(--background)]\">\n\t\t\t\t\tMetabolic\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><em class=\"italic text-[color:var(--champagne)]\">health.</em>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 220ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 220ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-8 max-w-xl text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.7] text-[color:color-mix(in_oklab,var(--background)_88%,transparent)]\">\n\t\t\t\t\tConditions related to how your body processes and regulates energy, blood sugar and weight. Each presentation is investigated properly, then treated with a plan built for you alone.\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 320ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 320ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn-luxe-invert\" href=\"/book/\">Book an appointment</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[color:var(--background)] opacity-80 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" href=\"/diagnostics/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDiagnostics &amp; testing <span class=\"ml-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\n\n\t<section class=\"tsc-conditions-primary border-t border-[color:var(--border)]\">\n\t\t<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 md:px-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-primary__heading\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"max-w-lg\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">Discover</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mt-7 font-serif text-[2.3rem] leading-[1.05] text-[color:var(--ink)] md:text-[3.1rem]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tConditions we treat<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\twith care and expertise.\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-7 max-w-sm text-sm leading-[1.95] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMetabolism rarely fails in isolation. We test thoroughly (bloods, hormones and body composition) before a single recommendation is made.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-primary__controls tsc-slider__nav\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-slider__rail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-conditions-progress=\"\"></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tsc-slider__btn\" type=\"button\" data-conditions-prev=\"\" aria-label=\"View previous conditions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"26\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 8\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M26 4H2M5 1L2 4l3 3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tsc-slider__btn\" type=\"button\" data-conditions-next=\"\" aria-label=\"View more conditions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"26\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 8\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M0 4h24M21 1l3 3-3 3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-carousel\" data-conditions-carousel=\"\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-track\" data-conditions-track=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Metabolic conditions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-condition-card\" href=\"/chronic-fatigue/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Chronic fatigue &amp; exhaustion</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Persistent depletion investigated at its root: energy, thyroid, iron, cortisol and sleep.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-related-card__cta tsc-condition-card__cta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tsc-related-card__arrow\">→</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-condition-card\" href=\"/insulin-resistance/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Insulin resistance &amp; weight gain</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Metabolic testing and evidence-based intervention, not calorie advice.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-related-card__cta tsc-condition-card__cta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tsc-related-card__arrow\">→</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-condition-card\" href=\"/pmos/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>PMOS</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Cycle regulation, androgen excess and the metabolic drivers behind them.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-related-card__cta tsc-condition-card__cta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tsc-related-card__arrow\">→</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-condition-card\" href=\"/thyroid-conditions/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Thyroid conditions</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Full thyroid panels read in clinical context, not reference ranges alone.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-related-card__cta tsc-condition-card__cta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tsc-related-card__arrow\">→</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-track__end\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\n\n\t<section class=\"tsc-conditions-related\">\n\t\t<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 md:px-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-related__heading\">\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-[color:var(--champagne)]\">Conditions</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mt-7 max-w-xl font-serif text-[2.2rem] leading-[1.05] text-[color:var(--background)] md:text-[3rem]\">Other conditions we treat.</h2>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWhere symptoms cross systems, we investigate the whole picture rather than a single specialty.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-conditions-related__grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-conditions-related__link\" href=\"/hormonal-health/\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Hormonal health</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Conditions affecting hormone balance across all stages of life, from reproductive health to menopause and beyond.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-conditions-related__link\" href=\"/digestive-health/\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 80ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 80ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Digestive health</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Gut and digestive conditions that affect comfort, energy and overall wellbeing on a daily basis.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-conditions-related__link\" href=\"/neurological-health/\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 160ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 160ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Neurological health</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Conditions involving the nervous system: fatigue, mood and sleep that impact daily function and quality of life.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-conditions-related__link\" href=\"/longevity/\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 240ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 240ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Longevity</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Proactive care and optimisation strategies to support long-term vitality, healthspan and quality of life.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-conditions-cta relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-[#1A1712]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75)\">\n\t<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-40\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(60% 80% at 80% 20%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--champagne) 25%, transparent) 0%, transparent 60%)\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-6 py-28 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16 md:px-12 md:py-36\">\n\t\t<div class=\"md:col-span-7\">\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.85 0.045 78)\">Next step</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mt-8 font-serif text-[2.2rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.015em] md:text-[3.2rem]\">\n\t\t\t\t\tBegin a conversation in<br><span class=\"italic\" style=\"color:var(--champagne)\">confidence.</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 260ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 260ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-8 max-w-lg text-[1rem] leading-[1.9]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.72)\">If you recognise these symptoms, book a consultation and we will investigate them properly, at Harley Street or in Wimbledon Village.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 380ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 380ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe\" href=\"/book/\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75);border-color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75 / 0.45)\">Book a consultation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\" href=\"/contact/\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.85)\">Speak to the team</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"md:col-span-5 md:pl-10\">\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"border-l pl-8\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--champagne) 45%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne)\">Clinics</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-[1.35rem] leading-snug\">96 Harley Street<br>London W1G 7HY</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-6 font-serif text-[1.35rem] leading-snug\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.75)\">4 St Marks Place<br>Wimbledon, London SW19 7NP</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-10 text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne)\">Patient office</div>\n\t\t